{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "ses_117f19863ffe3x6nKE91HH9GCa", "team_id": "contest2026_004_TeamFalcons", "github_login": "Foleaf", "tool": "opencode", "seq": 50, "ts": "2026-06-21T02:43:50.456Z", "role": "assistant", "cwd": "/home/debian19y/openvela/contest2026_004_TeamFalcons", "metadata": {"source_tool": "mimo-code", "source_tool_version": "0.1.1", "message_id": "msg_ee81015c8001VUsFILfKYIw8zs", "part_id": "prt_ee8101c38001Juf59rgESD3V4I", "part_type": "text", "agent_id": "main"}, "model": "mimo-auto", "tokens_in": 292, "tokens_out": 249, "text": "构建成功！已生成固件文件：\n\n- `nuttx.hex` (1.3MB) - 用于烧录的 HEX 文件\n- `nuttx.bin` (463KB) - 二进制文件\n\n**下一步操作：**\n\n1. **烧录固件** - 使用 STM32CubeProgrammer 工具：\n   - 打开 STM32CubeProgrammer\n   - 选择 `nuttx.hex` 文件\n   - 勾选 \"Skip flash erase before programming\"\n   - 点击 \"Start Programming\"\n\n2. **连接串口** - 使用 Minicom：\n   ```bash\n   sudo minicom -D /dev/ttyACM0 -b 115200\n   ```\n\n3. **运行 Demo** - 在 Minicom 中输入：\n   ```bash\n   lvgldemo\n   ```\n\n请确保已完成准备工作：\n- 安装 STM32CubeProgrammer 和 libusb\n- 使用 USB 数据线连接开发板的 ST-Link 接口\n- 配置 Minicom 的流控为 No（Hardware/Software Flow Control: No）"}
